<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; text-transform: uppercase">About Amun Organics</h2><div style="border-top: 1px solid #000000">
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What is Amun Organics?</summary><div>Amun Organics makes grass-fed tallow hair and skin care that harnesses the healing powers of ingredients from the Earth.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Where can I buy Amun Organics products?</summary><div>Our full collection is available here on amunorganics.com, shipping to the United States and Mexico.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Are your products and packaging sustainable?</summary><div>We bottle every formula in glass, which is recyclable and non-reactive, and we use tallow sourced as a byproduct of the meat industry.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Where does your tallow come from?</summary><div>We source our tallow ethically from grass-fed animals.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Will tallow make my hair greasy?</summary><div>No. Used as directed and rinsed thoroughly, our formulas cleanse and condition while leaving hair soft rather than coated.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Are your products free from synthetic fragrance?</summary><div>Yes. Our formulas are free from synthetic chemicals, added fragrances and hormone disruptors.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Curious about price increases?</summary><div>We keep our prices as steady as we can. When ingredient or glass costs change, we will always share the reason with you.</div></details>
</div></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; text-transform: uppercase">Shipping, Returns &amp; Everything In Between</h2><div style="border-top: 1px solid #000000">
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Why is my order taking longer than expected to ship?</summary><div>During launches and busy seasons, orders can take a few extra business days to leave our studio. You will receive tracking as soon as yours ships.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What is your return and refund policy?</summary><div>Please see our Shipping and Returns page for the full policy and timelines.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What is your exchange policy?</summary><div>Reach out through our <a href="/pages/contact-us" style="text-decoration: underline">Contact page</a> and we will help you find the right formula.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>I want to cancel or edit my order.</summary><div>Contact us as soon as possible. If your order has not shipped yet, we will do our best to update it.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>How can I check the status of my order?</summary><div>Use the tracking link in your shipping confirmation email, or log in to your account.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What happens if my order is marked as delivered but I can’t find it?</summary><div>Check with neighbours and around your delivery area, then contact us and we will help you resolve it with the carrier.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What payment forms do you accept?</summary><div>We accept all major credit cards and Klarna, which lets you pay in 4 interest-free installments.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you accept gift cards?</summary><div>Yes. Gift cards can be applied at checkout.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you offer a sampling program?</summary><div>We do not offer samples at the moment. Our Bundle &amp; Save sets are the best-value way to try the full ritual.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you offer any referral discounts or programs?</summary><div>Join our list to get 10% off your first order and hear about future programs.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Where do you ship your products?</summary><div>We currently ship to the United States and Mexico.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>What are my options for shipping?</summary><div>Shipping options and rates are shown at checkout. Orders over $150 ship free with standard shipping.</div></details>
</div></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; text-transform: uppercase">Subscriptions</h2><div style="border-top: 1px solid #000000">
<details class="faq-item"><summary>How does the subscription program work?</summary><div>Choose Subscribe &amp; Save on any product page to save 10% and receive your favorites on a schedule you set.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item"><summary>Which products are included in the subscription?</summary><div>Our haircare formulas are available on subscription.</div></details>
